<p>Momino qissa e sadaat suno<br />
thaam kar dil ye meri baat suno<br />
noor e kaunain madina hai jaha&#39;n<br />
ek mahella bani hashim hai waha&#39;n<br />
ek mahelle ke ek ghar ka bayaa&#39;n<br />
jisse behtar nahi duniya mein makaa&#39;n<br />
deen o eemaan ke kirdaar ka ghar<br />
panjetan paak ke anwaar ka ghar<br />
dukhtar e Ahmed e mukhtar ka ghar<br />
fatima haider e qarrar ka ghar<br />
laadle..(3), inke hasan aur hussain<br />
aur do betiya&#39;n thi noor e ayn<br />
ek kulsoom thi, ek baap ka zayn<br />
aur abbas dilo jaan ka chayn<br />
ghar ye tha bayt e khuda<br />
jisme qur&#39;aa utra<br />
aur kis tarha luta<br />
inka rutba na zamana samjha</p>

<p>ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra</p>

<p>Kaisi mazloom magar thi zahra<br />
baap ke ghum me bhi rone na diya<br />
haq se mehroom kiya wa abata<br />
aaj bhi jiski lahad be saaya<br />
jispe jalta huwa darwaza gira<br />
hogayi pehlu shakista zahra<br />
qatl mohsin bhi hua wawaila<br />
baad e zehra wo ali ka girya<br />
masjide..(3), kufa me phir shor utha<br />
haaye haider pe chali teghe jafa<br />
thi sada fusto be rabbil kaaba<br />
ghar mein zehra ke qayamat thi bapa<br />
sar se saaya jo utha<br />
ghar ye veeran huwa<br />
thi yateemo ki buka<br />
haaye baba, haaye baba baba</p>

<p>ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra..(2)</p>

<p>Baad e haider ye sitam aur huwa<br />
khoo&#39;n mein shabbar ka janaza dooba<br />
aur phir deen jo mushkil mein ghira<br />
tab hussain ibn e ali ghar se chala<br />
karbala jaise hi pohcha kunba<br />
phir to kya zulm na sayyed pe huwa<br />
milke laakho&#39;n ne unhe gher liya<br />
teen din pehle to paani na diya<br />
aur phir..(3)<br />
maqtale sadaat sajaa<br />
bhanje, bete, bhatija na raha<br />
na wo lashkar na alamadaar bacha<br />
asr se pehle wo halmin ki sadaa<br />
chal gayi teghe jafa<br />
khoon bekas ka baha<br />
sar suwe naiza gaya<br />
tan ko aghosh me zehra ne liya</p>

<p>ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra..(2)</p>

<p>Aa gayi shaam e ghareeba&#39;n haye haye<br />
aur phir aag lagi khaime jale<br />
ghash se jab aabid e beemar uthe<br />
qaidi kunbe ke wo salaar bane<br />
haaye sajjad ne kya kya dekha<br />
sar khule shaam me kunba dekha<br />
jashn darbaar mein hota dekha<br />
choti hamsheer ka laasha dekha<br />
qaid se..(3), chutke chale karbobala<br />
sab ka chehlum kiya matam bhi kiya<br />
qafila jab ye madine pohcha<br />
ab baya&#39;n sarwar o rehan ho kya<br />
haye matam tha bapa<br />
jab ye zainab ne kaha<br />
na rahi meri rida<br />
amma mai aagayi bhai na raha</p>

<p>ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra, ali, ya zahra..(2)</p>
